  "releaseNotes": "Column menus now portal to the document body so they anchor to their trigger and are never clipped by host containers (transform/overflow); outside-click still closes them. Redesigned pager to first/prev/\"Page X of Y\"/next/last with a double-chevron icon. Added GridColumn.MenuTitle. Fixed the rows-per-page selector losing the initial size, the filter popup repositioning, and row highlight/underbar not spanning horizontally scrolled columns.",
